    "show_share": true,
    "description": "A surgical simulation workshop on Laparoscopic Cholecystectomy was held in CIME. It is one of the most commonly performed abdominal surgical procedures that provides faster recovery, shorter hospitalization and smaller scars than conventional surgery. This workshopwas designed for general surgeons, fellows and residents to advance their cognitive proficiency and decisionmaking abilities as tactile skills are honed. From clipping the cystic duct to removing the gall bladder, this workshop simulated each critical step in this frequently performed laparoscopic procedure.",
